, including 15 of them spending $1 million or more annually with Datadog, and about 100 spending more than $100,000 annually.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/datadog-ddog-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2025 Q3","e":"ddog","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Olivier Pomel","x":"And as we prepare for general availability, we are getting very enthusiastic feedback on the time and cost savings enabled by Bits AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/datadog-ddog-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2025 Q3","e":"ddog","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Obstler","x":"As previously mentioned, we continue to see the impact of our engineers cost-saving efforts in Q3 as they deliver on our cloud efficiency project.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/datadog-ddog-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2025 Q3","e":"ddog","d":"2025-11-06","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Olivier Pomel","x":"So coding assistants and vibe coders and everything in that range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/datadog-ddog-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2025 Q4","e":"ddog","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Olivier Pomel","x":"We are also building out our internal developer portal, which includes software catalog and scorecards to help developers navigate infrastructure and application complexity, provide rich context to AI development agents and ultimately enable a faster release cadence.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/datadog-ddog-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2025 Q4","e":"ddog","d":"2026-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Olivier Pomel","x":"We delivered Kubernetes Autoscaling, so users can quickly identify which overprovisioned clusters and deployments and right-size their infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/datadog-ddog-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2025 Q4","e":"ddog","d":"2026-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Olivier Pomel","x":"This long-time customer uses the Datadog platform across many products, but still has over 30 other observability tools and embarked on consolidating for cost savings and better outcomes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/datadog-ddog-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2026 Q1","e":"ddog","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Olivier Pomel","x":"We are pleased with the way we started 2026 as we support our customers inflection in AI usage and application development and as they lean into our AI innovations, including Bits AI SRE Agent, Bits AI Security analyst Bits Assistant, Datadog IT server, GPU monitoring and many more.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/datadog-ddog-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2026 Q1","e":"ddog","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Obstler","x":"So -- and AI investment is probably helping the overall as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/datadog-ddog-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2026 Q2","e":"ddog","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Olivier Pomel","x":"By deploying observability using Datadog, they gain visibility across their training infrastructure and GPU fleets and can iterate faster on their AI models.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/datadog-ddog-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2026 Q2","e":"ddog","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Olivier Pomel","x":"Now customers were spending a lot on AI and they were wondering what to optimize cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/datadog-ddog-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DDOG 2026 Q3","e":"